      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing deep emotional exhaustion, a sense of burnout that goes beyond mere tiredness. When the main drive is spent, the quiet that follows can feel deafening and final. This quiet isn't necessarily the end, but a signal that your internal needs have shifted dramatically. It might be time to intentionally step back from striving and allow yourself a period of genuine rest, without the pressure of needing to \"do\" something new.",
      "source": "target",
